{
  "uid": "uxi-game",
  "title": "UnboundXI — Game",
  "description": "Aggregate gameplay: who plays what, how fast they progress, how fights go, what they use and how they talk. No figure here names a player.",
  "tags": ["unboundxi", "game"],
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
  "links": [
    { "title": "Services", "type": "link", "url": "/d/uxi-services", "icon": "dashboard", "keepTime": true }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Data source",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": { "text": "Prometheus", "value": "prometheus" },
        "hide": 0
      },
      {
        "name": "job",
        "label": "Job",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "query": { "query": "label_values(unbound_worker_played_seconds_total, player_job)", "refId": "job" },
        "definition": "label_values(unbound_worker_played_seconds_total, player_job)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "band",
        "label": "Level band",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "query": { "query": "label_values(unbound_worker_played_seconds_total, band)", "refId": "band" },
        "definition": "label_values(unbound_worker_played_seconds_total, band)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "zone",
        "label": "Zone",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "query": { "query": "label_values(unbound_worker_players, zone)", "refId": "zone" },
        "definition": "label_values(unbound_worker_players, zone)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Overview — now",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading these figures",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Aggregates only: job, level band (or level), zone, monster family, content slug, reason, solo or party. Nothing names a character, account or session.\n\nPanels marked **lab** read the same figure `cargo xtask lab-sweep` prints: *kill time* is its median time to kill from engage, *experience per played hour* its `--chain` pace. Pick the job and band here, then sweep the same job and levels (docs/spec/deployment.md, \"The admin dashboards\").\n\nFigures over **the time range** use the picker above; *now* panels read the last scrape."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Players online",
      "description": "Characters in zone on every worker, under the job, band and zone picked.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 3, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(unbound_worker_players{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\",zone=~\"$zone\"})", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value" }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Sessions on gateways",
      "description": "Connections admitted and running on every gateway, the ones still on their way into a zone included.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 3, "x": 9, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(unbound_gateway_sessions)", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value" }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Logins in range",
      "description": "Sessions the gateways admitted over the time range.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 3, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(increase(unbound_gateway_sessions_total[$__range]))", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value" }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Sessions ended in range",
      "description": "Admitted sessions that ended over the time range: by the client's own logout, or disconnected for any other reason.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 3, "x": 15, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(unbound_gateway_session_ends_total[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "{{reason}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name", "orientation": "horizontal" }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Median session length",
      "description": "The middle session's length, admission to end, among sessions that ended over the time range; interpolated within its bucket.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 3, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (increase(unbound_gateway_session_seconds_bucket[$__range])))", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value" }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Solo or in a party now",
      "description": "Characters in zone by whether their social card names a party (an alliance counts as a party).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 3, "x": 21, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (group) (unbound_worker_players{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\",zone=~\"$zone\"})", "legendFormat": "{{group}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "pieType": "donut", "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "values": ["value"] }, "displayLabels": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Players online, solo and in a party",
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 15, "x": 6, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (group) (unbound_worker_players{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\",zone=~\"$zone\"})", "legendFormat": "{{group}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "custom": { "stacking": { "mode": "normal" }, "fillOpacity": 30 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "right" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Logins and session ends per hour",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(rate(unbound_gateway_sessions_total[$__rate_interval])) * 3600", "legendFormat": "logins" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(unbound_gateway_session_ends_total[$__rate_interval])) * 3600", "legendFormat": "ended: {{reason}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Session length, sessions ended in range",
      "description": "Sessions that ended over the time range, by length: each bar counts the sessions longer than the bound before it and at most its own, in seconds (60 a minute, 3600 an hour, 86400 a day).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 7 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (le) (increase(unbound_gateway_session_seconds_bucket[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "{{le}}", "instant": true, "format": "heatmap" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "displayName": "${__field.labels.le}", "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "color": { "mode": "continuous-BlPu" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "orientation": "vertical", "displayMode": "gradient", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showUnfilled": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Population",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Players by job now",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sort_desc(sum by (player_job) (unbound_worker_players{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\",zone=~\"$zone\"}))", "legendFormat": "{{player_job}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "displayName": "${__field.labels.player_job}", "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "namePlacement": "top", "sizing": "manual", "maxVizHeight": 36, "text": { "titleSize": 14, "valueSize": 18 }, "displayMode": "basic", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showUnfilled": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Players by level band now",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (band) (unbound_worker_players{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\",zone=~\"$zone\"})", "legendFormat": "{{band}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "displayName": "${__field.labels.band}", "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "namePlacement": "top", "sizing": "manual", "maxVizHeight": 36, "text": { "titleSize": 14, "valueSize": 18 }, "displayMode": "basic", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showUnfilled": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Players by zone now",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sort_desc(sum by (zone) (unbound_worker_players{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\",zone=~\"$zone\"}) > 0)", "legendFormat": "{{zone}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "displayName": "${__field.labels.zone}", "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "namePlacement": "top", "sizing": "manual", "maxVizHeight": 36, "text": { "titleSize": 14, "valueSize": 18 }, "displayMode": "basic", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showUnfilled": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Hours played by job in range",
      "description": "Character-hours in zone over the time range: what jobs people actually spend their time on, not only who is on now.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sort_desc(sum by (player_job) (increase(unbound_worker_played_seconds_total{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\"}[$__range])) / 3600)", "legendFormat": "{{player_job}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "displayName": "${__field.labels.player_job}", "unit": "h", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "namePlacement": "top", "sizing": "manual", "maxVizHeight": 36, "text": { "titleSize": 14, "valueSize": 18 }, "displayMode": "basic", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showUnfilled": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Hours played by job and level band in range",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (player_job, band) (increase(unbound_worker_played_seconds_total{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\"}[$__range])) / 3600", "instant": true, "format": "table" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "h", "decimals": 1 }, "overrides": [] },
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true }, "renameByName": { "Value": "hours" } } },
        { "id": "groupingToMatrix", "options": { "columnField": "band", "rowField": "player_job", "valueField": "hours" } }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm" }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Players online by job",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (player_job) (unbound_worker_players{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\",zone=~\"$zone\"})", "legendFormat": "{{player_job}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "custom": { "stacking": { "mode": "normal" }, "fillOpacity": 20 } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "right" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Progression",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Median played time to the next level, by level",
      "description": "Played seconds from reaching a level to reaching the next, for the jobs picked, among level-ups over the time range. Timed within one stay on a worker, from a level-up seen there or a bar at nothing on arrival; levels never seen reached are not timed.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 34 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sort(histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (level, le) (increase(unbound_worker_level_up_seconds_bucket{player_job=~\"$job\"}[$__range]))) >= 0)", "legendFormat": "{{level}} → next", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "displayName": "${__field.labels.level} → next", "unit": "s", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "namePlacement": "top", "sizing": "manual", "maxVizHeight": 36, "text": { "titleSize": 14, "valueSize": 18 }, "displayMode": "gradient", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showUnfilled": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Level-ups timed in range, by job and level",
      "description": "How many level-ups were timed and their mean played time, for the jobs picked.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 34 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (player_job, level) (increase(unbound_worker_level_up_seconds_count{player_job=~\"$job\"}[$__range])) > 0", "instant": true, "format": "table" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum by (player_job, level) (increase(unbound_worker_level_up_seconds_sum{player_job=~\"$job\"}[$__range])) / (sum by (player_job, level) (increase(unbound_worker_level_up_seconds_count{player_job=~\"$job\"}[$__range])) > 0)", "instant": true, "format": "table" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "decimals": 0 }, "overrides": [
        { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Value #B" }, "properties": [ { "id": "unit", "value": "s" }, { "id": "displayName", "value": "mean played time" } ] },
        { "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Value #A" }, "properties": [ { "id": "displayName", "value": "level-ups" } ] }
      ] },
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "merge", "options": {} },
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true } } },
        { "id": "sortBy", "options": { "sort": [ { "field": "level" } ] } }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm" }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Experience per played hour, by job — lab",
      "description": "Experience paid for kills over the time range, divided by the hours played in the same job and band: the live figure beside the lab's --chain pace.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 43 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sort_desc(sum by (player_job) (increase(unbound_worker_experience_total{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\"}[$__range])) / (sum by (player_job) (increase(unbound_worker_played_seconds_total{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\"}[$__range])) / 3600))", "legendFormat": "{{player_job}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "displayName": "${__field.labels.player_job}", "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "namePlacement": "top", "sizing": "manual", "maxVizHeight": 36, "text": { "titleSize": 14, "valueSize": 18 }, "displayMode": "basic", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showUnfilled": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Experience per played hour, by level band — lab",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 43 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (band) (increase(unbound_worker_experience_total{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\"}[$__range])) / (sum by (band) (increase(unbound_worker_played_seconds_total{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\"}[$__range])) / 3600)", "legendFormat": "{{band}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "displayName": "${__field.labels.band}", "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "namePlacement": "top", "sizing": "manual", "maxVizHeight": 36, "text": { "titleSize": 14, "valueSize": 18 }, "displayMode": "basic", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showUnfilled": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Experience paid per hour, solo and shared",
      "description": "Experience paid across the world per hour, by whether the kill paid one earner or shared between several.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 43 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (group) (rate(unbound_worker_experience_total{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\"}[$__rate_interval])) * 3600", "legendFormat": "{{group}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "none", "decimals": 0, "custom": { "fillOpacity": 20, "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Combat",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 52 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Median kill time by level gap — lab",
      "description": "Seconds from a monster's engage to its death, over the time range, by its level less its claimer's: the lab's median time to kill from engage (even is its even match).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 53 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (gap, le) (increase(unbound_worker_kill_seconds_bucket{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\"}[$__range])))", "legendFormat": "{{gap}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "displayName": "${__field.labels.gap}", "unit": "s", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "namePlacement": "top", "sizing": "manual", "maxVizHeight": 36, "text": { "titleSize": 14, "valueSize": 18 }, "displayMode": "gradient", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showUnfilled": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Median even-match kill time by job — lab",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 53 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sort(histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (player_job, le) (increase(unbound_worker_kill_seconds_bucket{gap=\"even\",player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\"}[$__range]))))", "legendFormat": "{{player_job}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "displayName": "${__field.labels.player_job}", "unit": "s", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "continuous-GrYlRd" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "namePlacement": "top", "sizing": "manual", "maxVizHeight": 36, "text": { "titleSize": 14, "valueSize": 18 }, "displayMode": "gradient", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showUnfilled": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Kills and median kill time, solo and party",
      "description": "Kills timed over the time range and their median engage-to-death seconds, by whether the claim was held alone or by a party.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 53 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (group, le) (increase(unbound_worker_kill_seconds_bucket{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\"}[$__range])))", "legendFormat": "median {{group}}", "instant": true },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum by (group) (increase(unbound_worker_kill_seconds_count{player_job=~\"$job\",band=~\"$band\"}[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "kills {{group}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "purple" } }, "overrides": [
        { "matcher": { "id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B" }, "properties": [ { "id": "unit", "value": "none" }, { "id": "decimals", "value": 0 }, { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" } } ] }
      ] },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "none", "textMode": "value_and_name", "orientation": "horizontal" }
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Player melee hit rate by job",
      "description": "Share of player melee swings that hit (crits included), over the time range.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 61 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (player_job) (increase(unbound_worker_strikes_total{attacker=\"player\",strike=\"melee\",outcome=~\"hit|critical\",player_job=~\"$job\"}[$__range])) / sum by (player_job) (increase(unbound_worker_strikes_total{attacker=\"player\",strike=\"melee\",player_job=~\"$job\"}[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "{{player_job}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "displayName": "${__field.labels.player_job}", "unit": "percentunit", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "max": 1, "color": { "mode": "continuous-RdYlGr" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "namePlacement": "top", "sizing": "manual", "maxVizHeight": 36, "text": { "titleSize": 14, "valueSize": 18 }, "displayMode": "gradient", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showUnfilled": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Player critical rate by job",
      "description": "Share of player melee hits that crit, over the time range.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 61 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (player_job) (increase(unbound_worker_strikes_total{attacker=\"player\",strike=\"melee\",outcome=\"critical\",player_job=~\"$job\"}[$__range])) / sum by (player_job) (increase(unbound_worker_strikes_total{attacker=\"player\",strike=\"melee\",outcome=~\"hit|critical\",player_job=~\"$job\"}[$__range]))", "legendFormat": "{{player_job}}", "instant": true }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "displayName": "${__field.labels.player_job}", "unit": "percentunit", "decimals": 1, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "namePlacement": "top", "sizing": "manual", "maxVizHeight": 36, "text": { "titleSize": 14, "valueSize": 18 }, "displayMode": "basic", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "showUnfilled": true }
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Outcome shares by attacker and strike",
      "description": "Each outcome's share of its attacker's strikes of that kind over the time range: swings hit, crit or miss; magic rolls land or are resisted. The monster's and pets' rows carry no job.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 61 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (attacker, strike, outcome) (increase(unbound_worker_strikes_total{player_job=~\"$job|none\"}[$__range])) / ignoring (outcome) group_left sum by (attacker, strike) (increase(unbound_worker_strikes_total{player_job=~\"$job|none\"}[$__range]))", "instant": true, "format": "table" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "decimals": 1 }, "overrides": [] },
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true }, "indexByName": { "attacker": 0, "strike": 1, "outcome": 2, "Value": 3 }, "renameByName": { "Value": "share" } } },
        { "id": "sortBy", "options": { "sort": [ { "field": "attacker" } ] } }
      ],
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm" }
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Magic resist rate by caster",
